domain CommitThenAgencyInventory:
  description "Commit reviewed planning WIP before executing the next authorized plan tasks."

problem P1:
  |
    The owner requests a commit first, then execution of the reviewed repair plan.
    t026 is next: typed actual payload inventory and comparison fixture freezing.
premise P2:
  |
    ADR-0027 responsibility is accepted, detailed contracts remain unaccepted.
    Authority includes local commit and plan execution up to the next owner gate,
    not push, paid provider use, deployment or unaccepted runtime redesign.
evidence E1:
  |
    Refreshed repository state: matching worktree and branch at c63c526, origin/main
    1cdf210, twenty ahead and zero behind. Current WIP is the prior ADR acceptance,
    comment tags, impact plans and Seal records, with 31 clean REF and fsck ok.
evidence E2:
  |
    Sealgraph storage-format specifies config, immutable objects and REF manifests
    as canonical; index/source bindings, logs, locks and caches must not be tracked.
    Current graph has only relative local bindings. Its sources are repository
    documents/code, not paid-run response payloads or credentials.
evidence E3:
  |
    Existing battle-speech-wiring tests and replay harness exercise real projection
    through Mock/OpenAI-compatible test doubles. Existing old helpers contain
    assertions, so new inventory fixtures must use typed construction rather than
    copy unchecked casts.
premise OPTIONS:
  |
    A: Commit the entire .sealgraph tree, including runtime state. Rejected by
    storage contract. B: Commit canonical graph and reviewed WIP with local runtime
    exclusions, then use network-zero typed boundary fixtures. C: Implement new
    runtime schema immediately; outside pending contract acceptance.
pending U1:
  |
    Actual typed inventory, complete phase/generation matrix, feasible action sets
    and detailed goal-writer schemas are not yet established. New behavior quality
    and paid comparison remain unverified.
decision D1 based_on P1, P2, E1, E2, OPTIONS:
  |
    Add narrow graph runtime ignores, document the canonical commit boundary,
    inspect staged paths/content and commit the reviewed WIP locally. Verify
    committed object inventory and Git head before opening CA-00 edits.
decision D2 based_on P1, P2, E3, U1, OPTIONS:
  |
    Execute t026 using safe test doubles, actual projection/acceptance functions
    and typed fixture variants, not paid calls or runtime contract changes.
    Establish F01-F08 input variants and acceptance rubric; distinguish baseline
    observed gaps from treatment goals. Test, document, update/reseal the reviewed
    plan state only when completion evidence exists. Continue detailed design
    under the lifecycle rules, stopping at exact owner acceptance if required.
